description: English for code, comments, commits and pull requests
alwaysApply: true
---

# English only (except player catalogs)

- Write all code, identifiers, comments and technical docs in English.
- Write commit messages, PR titles and PR bodies in English.
- Player-facing strings belong in `apps/web/src/i18n/` (`en`, `pt-BR`, `es`, `fr`, `de`). Neo Urbe overrides live in `apps/neon/src/i18n.ts`. Do not hardcode UI copy in components.
- Chat with the user may stay in Portuguese when they write in Portuguese.
